  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop the red onion (see ingredients). Halve the cherry tomatoes. Roughly chop the coriander.\n• Thinly slice the avocado. Shred the cos lettuce (see ingredients). Drain the sweetcorn.\n• TIP: If you don't like raw onion in your salsa, feel free to leave it out!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/616e84bd34d4c71049513850/step-ae1e20c8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine the onion, cherry tomatoes and a drizzle of white wine vinegar.\n• Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/616e84bd34d4c71049513850/step-43188d6b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• SPICY! You may find the spice blend hot! Add less if you're sensitive to heat. In a medium bowl, combine the sweetcorn, shredded Cheddar cheese, Mexican Fiesta spice blend, plain flour, vegetable stock powder, milk and egg.\n• TIP: Lift out some of the mixture with a spoon. If it's too wet and doesn't hold its shape, add a little more flour",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/616e84bd34d4c71049513850/step-9df183cc.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, add enough olive oil to coat the base and heat over a medium-high heat.\n• When the oil is hot, add heaped tablespoons of the fritter mixture in batches and flatten with a spatula. Cook until golden, 3-4 minutes each side (don't flip too early!). Transfer to a plate lined with paper towel. You should get 3-4 fritters per person.\n• TIP: Be careful, the corn may pop in the pan!\n• TIP: Add extra olive oil between batches as needed.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/616e84bd34d4c71049513850/step-dcd87726.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the fritters are almost done, microwave the mini flour tortillas on a plate for 10 second bursts, until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/616e84bd34d4c71049513850/step-601495fa.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Halve the Mexican corn fritters. Spread the tortillas with some BBQ mayo. Fill with the shredded cos lettuce, avocado and Mexican corn fritters. Top with the cherry tomato salsa. Garnish with the coriander to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/616e84bd34d4c71049513850/step-424b7337.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
